The native port constructs monic quadratic division, witnessed principal-ideal
equivalence, both ring maps and inverse laws in an explicit setoid presentation.
It adapts the quotient and monic-remainder mathematics, without importing a
Lean export, a quotient-equality axiom or the complete Mathlib hierarchy.
